   * If this surprises you, please observe that (int)(1.000001 * 1e6)
   * is 1000000.  This is not a problem with precision, it's just how
   * FP numbers work.
   * See https://bugzilla.gnome.org/show_bug.cgi?id=697715. */
  usec = seconds * USEC_PER_SECOND;
